# Local-only and sensitive data. Keep these out of git.
**/node_modules/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/cache/
**/logs/
**/sessions/
**/attachments/
**/.credentials.yaml
**/.credentials.yaml.bak-*
**/*.bak-*
# Backup directories/folders of hand-copied files (e.g.
# dsh/plugins/<plugin>/.bak/client.js.bak). Transient by nature: never tracked,
# and the pattern above only catches the "<name>.bak-<stamp>" spelling.
**/.bak/
**/*.bak
**/DSH Desktop/
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.pak

# Root .gitignore ignores all lib/ directories; custom plugins' lib/* source
# files are tracked.
!dsh/plugins/*/lib/
!dsh/plugins/*/lib/*
